  "guidance": [
    "LiFePO4 (LFP) only for this project: safe, ~3,000-6,000 cycles, deep daily DoD (~80%), light vs lead-acid.",
    "No-weld rule: only bolt/stud/lug terminals; 'weld-only' flat-terminal cells are excluded (they need laser/spot welding).",
    "DIY EVE cells series to 12 V (4S) / 24 V (8S) / 48 V (16S); top-balance all cells in parallel to ~3.6 V before series assembly, and use a compression fixture.",
    "BMS sized to S-count & current (4S/8S/16S 100 A from ~$25); closed-loop comms (CAN/RS485) improves charge control when battery and inverter brands match.",
    "Every parallel string needs its own fuse; the bank needs a Class-T main fuse. Don't parallel packs of different age/chemistry/SoC.",
    "Lithium charge below freezing damages cells \u2014 use heated packs or a low-temp charge cutoff in cold climates.",
    "Battery Hookup DIY cells/modules sell out fast \u2014 re-verify price and stock at checkout."
  ],
